In all **_Residence Districts_**, the City Planning Commission may permit a non-commercial outdoor swimming pool club, or any non-commercial club with an outdoor swimming pool located less than 500 feet from any **_lot line_**, provided that the following findings are made:

(a) that such **_use_** is so located as not to impair the essential character or future use or development of the nearby residential neighborhood;

(b) that such **_use_** is so located as to draw a minimum of vehicular traffic to and through local **_streets_**;

(c) that such **_use_** has adequate reservoir space at the vehicular entrance to prevent the congestion of automobiles on the **_streets_**;

