(d) a variety of retail establishments; and
(e) **_uses_** that do not unduly affect the **_residential uses_** in the nearby area or conflict with future land use and development of adjacent areas.

The Commission may prescribe appropriate conditions and safeguards to minimize adverse effects of any such **_uses_** on publicly accessible areas.

