body_md:
The City Planning Commission has established the **_Special Planned Community Preservation District_** in areas that:

(a) have a land area of at least 1.5 acres;

(b) contain a minimum of three **_buildings_**;

(c) were designed and substantially **_developed_** as a unit under the regulations of the Zoning Resolution prior to December 15, 1961; and

(d) include considerable clustered **_open space_** and related **_commercial_** **_uses_** available to all residents of the District.

The Commission has found that existing site plans resulted in superior functional relationships of **_buildings_**, **_open spaces_**, pedestrian and vehicular circulation systems, including parking facilities, and other amenities all together creating an outstanding planned residential community.

