For any **_zoning lot_** in an R7-3 District, the City Planning Commission may permit modification of **_bulk_** regulations, except **_floor area ratio_** provisions, and modification of mandatory improvements, provided the Commission shall find that such modifications:

(a) will aid in achieving the general purposes and intent of the Special District;

(b) will enhance the distribution of **_bulk_** on the **_zoning lot_**;

