The Eastern Subarea shall include a public open area, within the location designated as **_Yankee Pier Plaza_** on Map 2 (Building Parcels, Primary Connection Locations and Esplanade) in the Appendix to this Chapter.

Such plaza:

(a) shall have a minimum area of 25,000 square feet;

